        "cash": null,
        "strategy": "- Rather than list each sub-boss separately, I'm covering them all in this one section, since each one requires basically the same strategy.\n- Each of their HP varies depending on **Yuri**, so if he's weaker, they'll be weaker as well, and vice versa.\n- If you want to use the **Mind's Eye**, just fuse into **Amon** and wail on them for a few rounds, making sure to heal if necessary.\n- If you don't want to use the **Mind's Eye**, fuse into the highest level monster that is the opposite class of the one you're fighting.\n- Make sure to keep yourself healed if you fear that you'll be taken down fairly easily."
      }
