    "shops": [],
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "description": "- You most likely have all of **Yuri**'s **Level 2 Fusions** already, but there's a chance you won't have all of the **Level 3 Fusions**.\n- To get the ultimate Fusion, the **Seraphic Radiance**, we need to have every other Fusion, including **Amon**.",
        "type": "exploration",
        "rewards": [],
        "notes": [
          {
            "type": "tip",
            "title": "Note",
            "text": "If for some reason you didn't acquire all of the **Gravestones** earlier as directed in the walkthrough, go to **[W-S-05] Yuri's Gravestones** so you can get them before continuing on."
          },
          {
            "type": "tip",
            "title": "Note",
            "text": "- Also, if you check the phone in Old Carl's house in **Old Castle Street**, it'll give you hints as to the locations of those **Gravestones**.\n- If you've already found them all, the \"Dad\" on the other line won't hint anything else to you, just saying that it looks like you found them already."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "description": "Where to earn **Soul Energy** (prior to Neameeto):\n- **Light** - **Blue Castle** (Hollow x2); **Cave Temple** (Penalty x3); **Nemeton Monastery**, **Underground Ruins** (Sin x2)\n- **Fire** - **Dollhouse** (**Ghouler** x2); **Ancient Ruins** (**Basilisk** x1)\n- **Earth** - **Calios Mental Hospital** (Doom x2); **Nemeton Monastery**, **Underground Ruins** (Inverse x2); **Ancient Ruins** (Sweeper x2)\n- **Dark** - **Calios Mental Hospital** (**Buggs** x5); **Nemeton Monastery**, **Underground Ruins** (**Guinea Pig** x3); **Blue Castle** (**Dead Knight** x2); **Cave Temple** (**Oingo** x2)\n- **Wind** - **Cave Temple** (**Buggy** x5); **Blue Castle** (**Gremlin** x3); **Calios Mental Hospital** (**Meat Eater** x2); **Dollhouse** (**Spanky** x2)\n- **Water** - **Dollhouse** (**Ghoul** x2); **Nemeton Monastery**, **Underground Ruins** (**Straithe** x2); **Ancient Ruins** (**Asp** x1)",
        "type": "exploration",
        "rewards": []
      },
