        "id": 4,
        "description": "To unlock the higher level Fusion's ???? attacks, **Yuri** must be **Berserk** as that Fusion. Once he is, he'll cast it on the enemy, and will know it from then on.",
        "type": "exploration",
        "rewards": []
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "description": "1. The best way to do this is to equip the **Small Jug** so 2 SP are taken per round, and the **Monk Earrings** so your SP is lower.\n2. Fight a battle, then go to the **Graveyard** and fight the **Malice**.\n3. Fuse **Yuri** into the Fusion you want, then keep Defending until **Yuri** goes **Berserk**, obliterating the Evil with your new spell.",
